{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22315","headline":"曲江早秋 · 白居易","name":"曲江早秋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋波红蓼水，夕照青芜岸。\n独信马蹄行，曲江池四畔。\n早凉晴後至，残暑暝来散。\n方喜炎燠销，复嗟时节换。\n我年三十六，冉冉昏复旦。\n人寿七十稀，七十新过半。\n且当对酒笑，勿起临风叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}